    // Shared memory: for each in_channel, 4 Winograd-domain values per tile
    // Layout: smem[tile_in_block][ic] for the 4 Winograd values stored interleaved
    // We process TILES_PER_BLOCK tiles; each needs 4 floats per ic.
    // Total: TILES_PER_BLOCK * Cin * 4 floats
